### Get All Categories
GET {{host}}/api/v1/categories
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get Category By ID
GET {{host}}/api/v1/categories/{{categoryId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Create Category
POST {{host}}/api/v1/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "for family",
  "description": "category that match for all family"
}


### Update Category
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "new category name"
}

### Delete Category
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
